
braam — a small operating system in a browser tab.

The whole filesystem is in OPFS and survives a reload; only /tmp is emptied
at boot. Every program in /bin is a wasm binary in a worker of its own.

edit is a full-screen editor: type to insert, ^S saves, ^Q quits, no modes.
Try: help, ls /bin, uname -a, df, echo hello > notes, edit notes
